  "title": "Two new image models, with clearer generation behavior",
  "summary": "Two image models, two text models, typed decisions, and a searchable model catalog joined a day of audio and tooling fixes.\n\nFLUX.3 Image and Seedream 5.0 Flash were added for generation and editing, each supporting up to 10 reference images. Veo 3.1 Fast now defaults to landscape video and generates audio only when requested. The final image-generation change keeps unseeded `/v1/images/generations` requests random; a same-day attempt to give them a fixed seed was reverted. The model catalog also shows image and other model rates in their actual billing units.\n\nLiquid D1 brings structured choice, score, and probability questions to the decisions and chat APIs, while the SDK gains a typed `decision()` helper for the existing decisions endpoint. Ling 3.1 Flash joins the text catalog with tool use and reasoning. Qwen3 Coder 30B moved to Bedrock under its existing public ID, with a narrower set of supported request options.\n\nModel-list endpoints and the MCP `listModels` tool gained search, capability, agent, and result-limit filters. `/v1/models` also returns category, community, and agent tags that Open WebUI can use in its model picker. Community-model owners now use Private instead of manual hiding; My Models shows when the reliability filter keeps a Public proxy out of listings. Catalog health reads from an hourly rollup, code-agent sync shows its resulting commit, and generated docs were updated.",
  "pr_count": 35,
